v1.7.0
Push notifications — approved viewers opt in with "Notify me" and are alerted when a new video is ready
Admins can broadcast a custom push message to all viewers from the Settings tab
Off by default — inert until the VAPID keys are configured
v1.8.0
Email a share link to its recipient (opt-in on the share form) and resend it from the Shares tab
Off by default — inert until a Resend API key is configured
The installed app now shows Admin for admin accounts (previously hidden in the installed app)
v1.9.0
Bulk share: pick multiple videos and multiple recipients at once, each pair gets its own private link, one email per recipient
Per-link view count and last-viewed time, plus real playback tracking (plays, furthest % watched, completed) from the video player
Bulk resend, bulk revoke, and bulk extend for selected links, each reporting per-item success/failure
Extend a link's expiry in place, including an already-lapsed-but-not-revoked link, without creating a new link
Bundles: a recipient with 2+ active links gets one consolidated listing page and one consolidated email instead of separate ones per link
v1.10.0
Watermark playback with the viewer's email — layered control: an exemption always wins, otherwise a share's own setting beats a video's, which beats a global default in Settings
Per-video analytics in the Videos tab: shares, unique recipients, views, started, completed and completion rate, and average watched progress
Bulk video operations: select multiple videos to delete or assign to a collection at once
